Not Windows specific. Lets celmech 1.5.8 run against current REBOUND 5 / SciPy / Python 3:
Simulation.N_real no longer exists in REBOUND 5 (N counts real particles), `xrange` is Python 2,
and recent SciPy's vode rejects the (n,1) right-hand side returned by the lambdified flow.

